  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5102.25 Everett Lake. No person shall operate a boat powered by gasoline, naptha or any other petroleum products on Everett Lake, also known as Clough State Park, in the town of Weare.\n\nSource. #5381, eff 4-21-92; ss by #6005, eff 3-24-95 (formerly Saf-C 402.231), EXPIRED: 3-24-03\n\nNew. #7904, INTERIM, eff 6-24-03, EXPIRED: 12-21-03\n\nNew. #8107, EMERGENCY, eff 6-22-04, EXPIRES: 12-19-04; ss and moved by #8172, eff 9-21-04 (from Saf-C 402.21); ss by #10169, EXEMPT, eff 8-8-12 (formerly Saf-C 402.23) (See Revision Note #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5100)",
